Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:26.20,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,420)\pos(268,125)}第11旅 和師父單拜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:41.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(640,210)}下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:41.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(640,480)}這就是旅行
